flowchart LR
    subgraph Host ["Developer Workstation / Docker Compose"]
        subgraph FrontendContainer ["Frontend Service (Port 5173)"]
            ReactApp["React 18 + TypeScript Shell"]
            QueryClient["TanStack Query Client"]
            UIComp["Shadcn / Tailwind Components"]
        end

        subgraph BackendContainer ["Backend Service (Port 8000)"]
            FastAPIApp["FastAPI Modular Application"]
            Middleware["RequestID & CORS Middleware"]
            CoreConfig["Pydantic v2 Settings"]
            HealthSvc["Health & Readiness Service"]
            FutureServices["Services (Ingestion, Hybrid Search, LangGraph, Validator)"]
        end

        subgraph DatabaseContainer ["Database Service (Port 5432)"]
            PG["PostgreSQL 16 Engine"]
            PGVector["pgvector Extension (384-dim)"]
            FTS["PostgreSQL Full-Text Search (tsvector)"]
            PGVolume[("Persistent Docker Volume\ncatalist_postgres_data")]
        end
    end

    ReactApp -->|HTTP Fetch /api/v1/*| FastAPIApp
    FastAPIApp --> Middleware
    FastAPIApp --> HealthSvc
    HealthSvc -->|SELECT 1 (5s timeout)| PG
    PG --> PGVector
    PG --> FTS
    PG --- PGVolume
